---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /blog/
title: "Business Analyst Career Blog: Practical BA Lessons"
description: "Weekly business analysis lessons from Tosin Ogunkoya: requirements, BPMN, stakeholders, prioritisation, certifications and growing your BA career."
breadcrumbs:
  - name: "Blog"
    url: "/blog/"
pageType: "CollectionPage"
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Blog</nav>
    <h1>The BA career blog</h1>
    <p class="lead">One practical topic a week, taught in five short lessons, Monday to Friday. Real situations from telecoms, real estate and the public sector, written for business analysts at every stage.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:1.5rem">
  <div class="wrap">
    {%- if collections.series.length %}
    <ul class="series-grid">
      {%- for s in collections.series %}
      <li class="series-card">
        {%- if s.cover %}<a href="/blog/series/{{ s.slug }}/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ s.cover }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="640" height="358"></a>{% endif %}
        <div class="series-card-body">
          <p class="eyebrow">Series · {{ s.posts.length }} lesson{% if s.posts.length != 1 %}s{% endif %} · {{ s.start | readableDate }}</p>
          <h2><a href="/blog/series/{{ s.slug }}/">{{ s.title }}</a></h2>
          <ol class="series-days">
            {%- for p in s.posts %}
            <li><a href="{{ p.url }}">{% if p.data.day %}Day {{ p.data.day }}: {% endif %}{{ p.data.title }}</a></li>
            {%- endfor %}
          </ol>
        </div>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- endif %}

    {%- if collections.standalonePosts.length %}
    <h2 style="margin-top:3rem">More articles</h2>
    <ul class="article-list">
      {%- for p in collections.standalonePosts %}
      <li><a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.data.title }}</a> <span class="muted">{{ p.date | readableDate }}</span></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- endif %}

    {%- if not collections.posts.length %}
    <p>Posts are being moved over from the old site. Check back shortly.</p>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>
